 "encounter_id": "00556",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ruth Abernethy? Just checking I've got the right file open."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's me. And this is my husband Graham. He's the reason I'm here, really."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She'd have cancelled again if I hadn't driven her."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good man. Right, colitis review. How have you been since I last saw you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Quite well, actually. It's been quiet. Well, mostly. I've been tired in the afternoons."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tired how? Needing a nap, or just flat?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Flat, I think. Not a nap. Well, perhaps a nap on Sunday, but that's the roast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Any bleeding at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not now. I had blood when I went to the loo last winter, but that settled in the spring. Or was it the summer? Graham?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Spring. March. You were fed up to the back teeth with it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Have you lost any weight?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, if anything I've put some on. Graham's baking."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any mouth ulcers?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None, thankfully."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, that's all fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your waterworks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal. Perfectly boring."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking for the colitis these days?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The mesalazine, 2.4 g once a day, I think. Or was it twice? Graham does the box."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's 1.6 g since the spring. They cut it down. And it's once a day, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it? Well, he'd know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll sort that against the prescription record. Anything else you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Vitamin D. The chewable ones. That's the lot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I was allergic to it as a child, came out in a rash, and I've been told to avoid it ever since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Any other conditions I should have on the list?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Migraines, a few a year. And my knees, the osteoarthritis. Oh, and the colitis itself, of course. Twelve years. No, hang on. Graham?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Eleven. You were diagnosed the year we moved."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eleven years, then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never smoked in my life."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass of wine on Saturdays. I only drink at weekends."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Let me do your numbers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 118 over 74. Pulse 68. Temperature 36.7.",
   "pause": 14
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Oxygen 98 per cent, and you're 71 kilograms on the scales."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little. Nothing to worry about. Hop onto the couch, please."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need to take my cardigan off? Oh, I've left my glasses in the car."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "They're on your head, love."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lie flat for me. I'll press on your tummy. Tell me if anything's sore.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft all over. Sit up when you're ready."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Marvellous. I thought you'd find something awful."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The way things look today, it fits with the colitis being in remission."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Remission. That sounds so grand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is, for a colitis patient. Carry on as you are with the tablets. Graham keeps the box, so we're in good hands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I've got a spreadsheet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "He really has."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll see you in three months, and you can bring the spreadsheet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three months. I'll put it in the diary. Where is my diary? Graham?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "In your handbag."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course it is."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, off you go, both of you. Mind the step on the way out."
  }
